      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Client: Hello."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "按摩师：请问您哪里比较疲劳？",
      "traditional": "按摩師：請問您哪裏比較疲勞？",
      "pinyin": "àn mó shī qǐng wèn nín nǎ lǐ bǐ jiào pí láo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Masseur: May I ask where you are tense?"
